    #
    # P3's text:
    # Milestone 3 part 3 P3 negative.log (specs/0025-sheet-and-print-settings.md,
    # "P3": "The negative log through the binary: the sample on a fixture whose
    # first sheet's table covers A1:H2 (refused with the overlap message, with a
