    # (Q) --printarea-sample:
    #       Q0 the bare template: the three names and the <autoFilter> created,
    #          exit 0, its line;
    #       T1 a table part on W whose ref is A1:H2, over the area: specs/0021's
    #          overlap message, "a table overlaps a table, a pivot table, a merge
    #          or the autofilter", from the write's check of W's tables;
    #       T1C the same table at A3:H9, clear of the area, the control for T1;
    #       A2 two <autoFilter> after the sheetData: the part's message, "a
    #          worksheet has two sheetPr, autoFilter, printOptions, ...", from the
    #          settings pass;
    #       A2C one <autoFilter>, the control for A2;
    #       F3 a row 1048576 with a cell, so M + 1 is past the grid: part 3's
    #          index message, from the print area call;
    #       F3C a row 2 with a cell, the control for F3.
    # Each refusal: exit 2, the error line exactly the message the committed
    # source holds, no stdout, no output file. Then the part's messages, read from
